        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>#18 in Top Paid on Google Play!</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>#2 in Top Strategy Games — that very game!</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero 2048 combines merge puzzle mechanics with strategic defense gameplay.<br>Merge and upgrade three distinct classes—Melee, Mage, and Ranged—up to level 9, and plan the optimal unit placement to counter each wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947360/extras/2531338f7630101c2958bdb0c4a89a1f.poster.avif?t=1756796597\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947360/extras/2531338f7630101c2958bdb0c4a89a1f.webm?t=1756796597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947360/extras/2531338f7630101c2958bdb0c4a89a1f.mp4?t=1756796597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on 70 challenging stages or push your limits in the endless Infinity Mode.<br>Unlock achievements, exploit synergy effects, and create powerful combinations to aim for the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947360/extras/bea8ab7350f870b9405bbcb0df9c537a.poster.avif?t=1756796597\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947360/extras/bea8ab7350f870b9405bbcb0df9c537a.webm?t=1756796597\" typ